{"parse": {"title": "12TH-23", "pageid": 127808, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-22\" title=\"12TH-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-23</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-24\" title=\"12TH-24\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">23</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.81.A5.E8.BF.9C.E7.9A.84.E8.B7.AF.E7.A8.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"遥远的路程\">遥远的路程</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 遥远的路程</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Long Road Ahead</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>历<span class=\"color-value\"></span>史<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>锤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>铁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>砧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>锤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>打<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>痕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11223</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我在东线的任务已经结束。在我写下这封信的不久前，别列格勒城及其周边发生了一场我没有预想过的战斗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>刚学会用枪的普通人藏在城市的街垒后，顽强地抵抗着匪军与重塑之手的进攻，最终让别列格勒免于沦陷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>屹立不倒的城市为野战部队争取到了施展战术的空间，骑兵军与他们的盟友得以放开手脚，击败敌军主力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>一部分居民不幸罹难，但更多人在这场战役中生还。他们保卫家乡的英勇事迹将在这片土地上永远流传。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>对了，我在这儿见到了卡戎，我猜你也会感到惊讶。可惜，时间仓促，还有太多事无法在信中写完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>真希望有一天能当面给你讲我在东线的故事。我马上会回基金会总部，亲爱的朋友，同样期待你平安的消息。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>只有这一封信吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士把匆匆写好的信折好，装进信封，郑重其事地印下了基金会的火漆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我不知道你会到这儿来，没有想到有机会送信过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你说你还会回一趟西线，那就拜托你把这封信带回蒙佩。会有人来取的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>噢，你是说那个石像鬼。别送蒙佩了，她早就不在那一带活动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你知道她的动向？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>不算知道，但在别的地方见过她几次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“猎犬”的表情像是被一阵不存在的冬日寒气挠了一下后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>第一次是在卢森堡。当时我正在那儿找一些东西。在我发现她的时候，枪口已经顶上了我的后脑勺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>我以为她是来讨债的，毕竟在299高地发生的事情并不愉快。要我说，刻雷乌斯欠她一份包含物质回报的感谢信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>但她只是想“和‘Ⅻ’小队的人谈谈”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你们说了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>大概是立了一些规矩。有时候，她的行动目标会和我们小队重合，这时候就要划分一下界限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>她会为我们提供帮助，条件是我们要向她分享在行动中获知的所有信息。她办事很利索，就是缺乏幽默感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>可能只是你的幽默感太糟糕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>哈。总之，虽然我不知道她的具体动向，但要再找到她一次应该并不困难，尤其是手上还有你给她的信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>那么，你怎么会被派到这里来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>刻雷乌斯要我来做一些“收尾工作”……啧，什么脏活累活都是我来干了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>我得观察骑兵军在战斗结束后的政治倾向有没有异常，确定他们和伊戈尔斩断了联系……啊，还有“乌鸫”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从怀中拿出一封文书，交给玛尔纱。后者带着一丝犹豫，展开折好的纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-312714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“梅蕾尔，接到此信后立刻前往顿河地区，隐藏身份秘密调查‘金色饥荒’。刻雷乌斯。11月……10日？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是梅蕾尔逃跑之前的命令，也就是说，她并不是逃亡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>这日期当然是假的。你把“乌鸫”的消息传回去之后，刻雷乌斯就在我眼前写了这封“密令”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>我出发的时候，签名上的龙血印章都还没有干透。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一些补办的文书工作，也许无伤大雅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>好吧……你确定这些事应该告诉我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叶尔莫莱的脸色变得很快，他出人意料地沉下脸来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>我们是一个队的队友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>之后一定还会有比这更糟的事，如果不能互相照应，我们迟早全都栽沟里，能懂吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……我明白你的意思了。梅蕾尔还在休息，要我把她叫来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我……我在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被一纸“密令”暂时解救的逃兵站在玛尔纱身后，她双手搭住骑士的肩甲，只探出半边脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叶尔莫莱越过骑士警戒的目光，对躲在后面的梅蕾尔扬了扬下巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>有保姆照顾你的日子结束了，“乌鸫”。虽然基金会不一定会来找你麻烦，但队内的惩罚可不能少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>队内惩罚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔闻言缓缓走出一个后撤步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>还想跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像抓兔子一样，男人将梅蕾尔从骑士身后揪出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>哎呀——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>喂，你小心点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>之后她就跟我走了，玛尔纱。刻雷乌斯要我给她打上跟踪药剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>跟踪药剂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>不知道哪儿的书呆子们研制的新玩意儿，需要实验样本。正好给这小老鼠打上，以免她再开溜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我不会了，相信我，我一定不会再跑了！我保证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>安静点，想让所有人都知道你干了什么吗？还是说想尝一尝苦哑巴药剂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……不想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不情不愿地咬住嘴唇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱轻轻拍了拍她的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>别担心，回去的路上我们还会在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑色的战马从街道另一侧匆匆跑来，在马儿身旁的是它熟悉的旅伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>梅蕾尔，很高兴你选择回到自己的朋友身边，希望你未来的旅途一路平安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>谢谢你为我提供的援助，玛尔纱，这个过程一定给你带来了很大的痛苦，一直以来我都为此自责……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>别往心里去，卡戎，你能恢复就好。我自己会把握使用神秘术的分寸的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>是你，收尸人。知道你也在东线的时候，我很意外。帕拉维扬告诉我，是你隐瞒了梅蕾尔的行踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>等、等等！卡戎和这件事儿没有关系！是我坚持要他这么做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>你着什么急？难道你不是为了遵守长官的命令，才要求卡戎为你隐藏行踪的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>呃……是的，不，真的是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>就是这样。给我记好了，以后不管什么人问你，你都要这么回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>好的……好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的亡者花了很长时间也没有弄明白“Ⅻ”小队的队员们在说什么，最终只好放弃寻找答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>死亡是平等的，对死亡的恐惧也是平等的。回避死亡是生者的本能，希望你能理解她的行为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">叶尔莫莱：</div><div>我完全理解。放心吧，梅蕾尔不会有事的，保证她平平安安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我所期望的莫过于此。那么，再见，各位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你又要离开了吗，卡戎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>你可以跟我一起回——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“基金会”三个字卡在她的喉咙里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>希望以后还能见到你，卡戎。当然，不是在战场上。我不想再看见更多的尸体了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>还有你，安德烈森。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔踮起脚，抱住了安德烈森的脖子，脸颊蹭上粗糙的鬃毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>再见了，我的朋友们。和你们一起的旅途很愉快……当然，落水的那部分除外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我会一直想念你们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>希望我们会在更和平的年代相见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亡者轻挽缰绳，与他的马儿一同走出城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们消失在冬日的草原，赶赴下一场没有终点的苦旅。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-23"}}